<section class="w-5/6 mx-auto mt-48" id="exp">
  <div class="flex items-center flex-col">
    <h1
      class="text-center bg-clip-text font-extrabold from-[#d7d7d7] text-transparent to-[#616161] md:text-5xl sm:text-3xl text-4xl bg-gradient-to-tr mb-8 aos-init aos-animate"
      data-aos="fade-up"
      data-aos-anchor-placement="center-bottom"
    >
      Experience
    </h1><p
      class="font-semibold text-center text-gray-400 text-lg aos-init aos-animate"
      data-aos="fade-up"
      data-aos-anchor-placement="center-bottom"
    >
    </p>
    <div class="flex justify-center gap-2 max-md:w-5/6 w-3/4 mt-16">
      <span class="bg-primary bg-opacity-25 rounded-md w-1"></span><div>
        <div class="flex flex-col font-semibold gap-y-8 text-primary">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-8 h-full">
            <span
              class="absolute -ml-[16px] animate-ping bg-sky-400 h-3 inline-flex opacity-75 rounded-full w-3 aos-init"
              data-aos="fade-right"></span><div
              class="flex flex-row bg-opacity-10 bg-primary/10 border-[1px] border-primary/10 px-8 py-4 max-md:px-2 aos-init aos-animate"
              data-aos="fade-up"
            >
              <div class="flex flex-col ml-6">
                <div
                  class="flex flex-row max-md:flex-col max-md:text-base text-2xl"
                >
                  <div class="flex flex-col flex-1">
                    <h1>Trueline Solution</h1><p>
                      At
                      <a class="text-indigo-300">Back-end Developer </a>
                    </p>
                  </div><p class="mt-2">From May 2025 To Current</p>
                </div><span
                  class="bg-primary bg-opacity-25 rounded-md h-0.5 mt-4 w-fill"
                ></span><ul
                  class="text-xl max-md:text-sm font-light list-disc mt-4"
                >
                  <li class="mb-2">
                    Developed and maintained <span
                      class="text-indigo-300 font-semibold">RESTful APIs</span
                    > for  <span class="text-indigo-300 font-semibold"> CRM </span> and <span class="text-indigo-300 font-semibold">e-commerce</span> and <span class="text-indigo-300 font-semibold">ERP Systems</span> platforms.</span>
                  </li>
                  <li class="mb-2">
                    Implemented secure authentication and <span class="text-indigo-300 font-semibold">role-based access  
                    control.</span>
                  </li>
                  <li class="mb-2">
                    Optimized database queries in <span class="text-indigo-300 font-semibold">MongoDB</span> and <span class="text-indigo-300 font-semibold">MySQL</span> for better
                    performance and scalability.
                  </li>
                  <li class="mb-2">
                    Integrated third-party services including <span class="text-indigo-300 font-semibold">payment gateways</span>
                    and <span class="text-indigo-300 font-semibold">external APIs.</span>
                    
                  </li>
                  <li class="mb-2">
                    Ensured smooth communication between front-end (React) and
                    back-end services
                  </li>
                  <li class="mb-2">
                    Designed <span class="text-indigo-300 font-semibold">scalable server-side architecture to handle high
                    traffic and large datasets.</span>
                  </li>
                  <li class="mb-2">
                    Followed clean code practices and <span class="text-indigo-300 font-semibold">proper file structuring</span>
                    for maintainability.
                  </li>
                  <li class="mb-2">
                    Work On 
                    365 CRM is a cloud-based lead management CRM geared towards Indian businesses, offering
  eatures like centralized lead tracking, automated follow-ups and reminders, team task management,
and real-time analytics on mobile

                  </li>
                   <li class="mb-2">
                    <span class="text-indigo-300 font-semibold"
                      >Technologies Used</span
                    >
                    <ul
                      class="text-xl max-md:text-sm font-light list-disc mt-2 pl-10"
                    >
                      <li>Node js</li>
                      <li>Mysql</li>
                      <li>MongoDB</li>
                      <li>FileZilla</li>
                      <li>Putty</li>
                      <li>Socket</li>
                    </ul>
                  </li>
                </ul>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="flex justify-center gap-2 max-md:w-5/6 w-3/4 mt-16">
      <span class="bg-primary bg-opacity-25 rounded-md w-1"></span><div>
