                  class="flex flex-row max-md:flex-col max-md:text-base text-2xl"
                >
                  <div class="flex flex-col flex-1">
                    <h1>Game Developer</h1><p>
                      At <a class="text-indigo-300">Dynotech Games</a>
                    </p>
                  </div><p class="mt-2">From Jan 2024 To july 2024</p>
                </div><span
                  class="bg-primary bg-opacity-25 rounded-md h-0.5 mt-4 w-fill"
                ></span><ul
                  class="text-xl max-md:text-sm font-light list-disc mt-4"
                >
                  <li class="mb-2">
                    Working on finance Innovative game, where I developed <span
                      class="text-indigo-300 font-semibold">5+ features</span
                    > including <span class="text-indigo-300 font-semibold"
                      >Multiplayers Games</span
                    > and <span class="text-indigo-300 font-semibold"
                      >Kinds Games
                    </span>.
                  </li>
                  <li class="mb-2">
                    Work on a Multyplayer Game With <span
                      class="text-indigo-300 font-semibold"
                      >Socket connection and API(Application Programming
                      Interface)</span
                    > it developed in android And also webGL
                  </li>
                  <li class="mb-2">
                    Implement firebase plugin like <span
                      class="text-indigo-300 font-semibold"
                      >Firebase analyst , Auth , Realtime Database</span
                    > due to Authenication and Dynatic data &amp; tasks
                  </li>
                  <li class="mb-2">
                    Implement Socket.io in <span
                      class="text-indigo-300 font-semibold">Multipler Game</span
                    > with Clealy and understandble code to <span
                      class="text-indigo-300 font-semibold"
                      >another Developer</span
                    >
                  </li>
                  <li class="mb-2">
                    Work on <span class="text-indigo-300 font-semibold"
                      >google adMob and other Ads like yodo ads</span
                    > to Create revnue for our application and also work on other
                    plugin like <span class="text-indigo-300 font-semibold"
                      >facebook login for Authenicate , Dotween</span
                    > for create Innovative Animation using Programming
                  </li>
                  <li class="mb-2">
                    <span class="text-indigo-300 font-semibold"
                      >Technologies Used</span
                    >
                    <ul
                      class="text-xl max-md:text-sm font-light list-disc mt-2 pl-10"
                    >
                      <li>Unity</li>
                      <li>C#</li>
                      <li>Firebase</li>
                      <li>Google Ads</li>
                      <li>Yodo Ads</li>
                      <li>Socket.io</li>
                      <li>Dotween</li>
                    </ul>
                  </li>
                </ul>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="flex items-center flex-col max-md:w-5/6 w-3/4 mt-12">
      <h1
        class="text-center bg-clip-text font-extrabold from-[#d7d7d7] text-transparent to-[#616161] md:text-5xl sm:text-3xl text-4xl bg-gradient-to-tr mb-8 aos-init aos-animate"
        data-aos="fade-up"
        data-aos-anchor-placement="center-bottom"
      >
        Education
      </h1>
      <div class="flex justify-center gap-2 max-md:w-5/6 w-3/4 mt-18">
        <span class="bg-primary bg-opacity-25 rounded-md w-1"></span><div>
          <div class="flex flex-col font-semibold gap-y-8 text-primary">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-8 h-full">
              <span
                class="absolute -ml-[16px] animate-ping bg-sky-400 h-3 inline-flex opacity-75 rounded-full w-3 aos-init"
                data-aos="fade-right"></span><div
                class="flex flex-row bg-opacity-10 bg-primary/10 border-[1px] border-primary/10 px-8 py-4 max-md:px-2 aos-init aos-animate"
                data-aos="fade-up"
              >
                <div class="flex flex-col ml-6">
                  <div
                    class="flex flex-row max-md:flex-col max-md:text-base text-2xl"
                  >
                    <div class="flex flex-col flex-1">
                      <h1>BSC IT</h1><p>
                        <a class="text-indigo-300"
                          >Bachelor of Science in Information Technology</a
                        >
                      </p><span
                        class="bg-primary bg-opacity-25 rounded-md h-0.5 mt-4 w-fill"
                      ></span><ul
                        class="text-xl max-md:text-sm font-light list-disc mt-4"
                      >
                        <li class="mb-2">
                          From <span class="text-indigo-300 font-semibold"
                            >Geetanji Group of Collage Rajkot</span
                          >
                          <br /> Sauratra university <span
                            class="text-indigo-300 font-semibold"
                            >(2022-2025)</span
                          >
                        </li>
                      </ul>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
